Z||000001||Formula88||07-04-2001||12:05 PM||||I'll have to give you that.  The 86-87 Buick 3.8 SFI Turbo was an awesome engine.  Too bad it's not made anymore.  I had one I bought right after Black Monday in 87.  Got a great deal!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  2nd fastest car I've ever owned.  Only my 72 TA was faster, by virtue of it's 455HO.  And the 20th Anniversary T/A with the 3.8 turbo is still the fastest Trans Am ever made.  Not even the new LS1 TA's can beat it! <P>The 3800SC is a good engine, but the 3.8 turbo was better, IMO.  Maybe not as refined, but a better performing power plant.||||reg||1
