Z||000056||Formula88||07-05-2001||10:58 PM||||NSX and 911.  Can't argue there.  Both are vastly superior technically to a GN.  Of course, they didn't sell for under $20K new, either.  If I could have a new GN, NSX or 911 - money no object, I'd likely get the NSX first, the 911 2nd, and the GN last.  I'd choose the NSX over the 911 simply because it's what I envision the Fiero COULD have been by now if Pontiac hadn't cancelled it.  <P>Hey, slammed, have you seen the video of some guys in a 911 (Turbo, I think) running from the cops in Stockholm?  It's about a 10 minute video of them speeding so the cops would pull them over- just so they could outrun them.  He had to be doing over 150+ in a lot of that video!  100+Mb download, but damn!||||reg||1
