Z||000068||Will||07-07-2001||10:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnnyK:<BR><B>No replacement for displacement? Sure there is. RPM and forced induction.. (NOt that I like FI, but anyhoo)</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>"Hello, Apple? This is Orange. You suck."<P>Let's compare apples to apples.<BR>A 3.2 litre engine running 15 lbs of boost and spinning to 8500 RPM will output approximately twice the power of a similarly cammed, tuned, etc. 1.6 litre running 15 lbs of boost and spinning to 8500 RPM.<P>There is no replacement for displacement.||||reg||1
